flowchart TD
    A[Customer enters store] --> B[Scan product QR / barcode]
    B --> C[Fetch product details]
    C --> D[Add item to digital cart]
    D --> E[Reserve inventory]
    E --> F{Customer continues?}
    F -->|Yes| B
    F -->|No| G[Checkout]
    G --> H[Mock / Sandbox Payment]
    H --> I{Payment successful?}
    I -->|No| J[Release reservation]
    J --> K[Show payment failure / retry]
    I -->|Yes| L[Confirm transaction]
    L --> M[Deduct inventory]
    M --> N[Generate digital receipt]
    N --> O[Exit verification]
    O --> P{Receipt valid?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Customer exits]
    P -->|No| R[Send to assisted verification]
